      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m saying we\u0027ll never get to this part of the code because the slot is already cleaned up.  https://screenshot.googleplex.com/4bGb2VZNjVvSnp7.png\n\nthat\u0027s why I\u0027m suggesting for `BTA_JvCancelDiscovery` to be called before `cleanup_rfc_slot`",
